From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 17:33:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] docs: describe research-stack v3 and focus tags

- Rewrite the Research Stack description in skills.ts, skills-catalog.md
  and docs/skills.md for v3: sub-question decomposition, tiered rounds,
  validation, focus tags, bundles and --target audit mode.
- Add a "Focus tags" subsection to docs/skills.md with the 11 tags,
  their addenda, the 4 bundles and an example.
- Add researchServers (Exa, DataForSEO, Mobbin, Refero, Socket, Semgrep,
  Context7, DeepWiki, Figma, Chrome DevTools) as a separate optional list
  on the MCP page so the 7+3 core count stays true. Add a "cli" server
  type for Semgrep. Update the Firecrawl and Perplexity descriptions.
- Align the research-stack promptfoo prompt and golden cases with the v3
  report sections and source tags; add --focus seo and --focus security
  cases; update the --youtube and --validate cases.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
